        "text": "The big one. 32 upstream commits land in miroshark-aeon — 69 files touched, +2,080/-662 lines. Two new skills arrive: flovia (live crypto data via Flovia MCP — Nansen smart money, CoinGecko, chain reads, Zerion wallets) and github-filing-registry (structured tracker for upstream issues/PRs filed by the agent, prevents duplicates, provides triage). The secretcurl utility is removed from version control (292 lines)."
      }
